    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d129">

                <pb facs="0514" n="475" xml:id="pg475"/>

                <head>129. National Security Decision Memorandum 14<anchor n="1" xml:id="d129-f1"/>
                </head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>Washington</placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1969-05-29">May 29, 1969</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <list type="description">
                    <label>TO</label>
                    <item>The Secretary of State</item>
                </list>
                <list subtype="subject" type="description">
                    <label>SUBJECT</label>
                    <item>Policy Toward Post-De Gaulle France</item>
                </list>
                <p>The President has reviewed the recommendations in the study requested by NSSM
                        55,<anchor n="2" xml:id="d129-f2"/> as reported by the Review Group,<anchor
                        n="3" xml:id="d129-f3"/> and has approved them as policy guidelines for the
                    next several weeks.</p>
                <p>Please take the necessary steps to ensure that all concerned, in Washington as
                    well as in the field, act in conformity with these guidelines.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed corresp="#p_KHA_1"> Henry A. Kissinger </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
